# GLO, 1st press: the 8-track mixer (view 3) = 8 sliders + 8 pan knobs. SELECT cycles G1 LEVELS, G2 LEVELS, G1 PANS, G2 PANS. K1-K4 = the four shown. Black keys 1-4 / 5-8 = group 1 / 2 (levels). GLO again: COMP, MEMORY, the settings list, back to the mixer
wait 300
tap GLO   # wip290: 1st press = VEL
expect view 15
tap GLO
expect view 3
shot gmix_a.png
turn K1 -30 80
turn K3 -60 80
shot gmix_b.png
turn SELECT 1
turn K2 -40 80
turn K4 -90 80
shot gmix_c.png
turn SELECT 1
turn K1 20 80
shot gmix_e.png
turn SELECT 1
turn K2 -30 80
shot gmix_f.png
tapkey b2
expect sel 2
shot gmix_d.png
tap GLO
expect view 4
tap GLO
expect view 4
tap GLO
expect view 4
tap GLO
expect view 15   # (wip290: back to the first GLO page, VEL)
tap GLO
expect view 3
expect curpage 3
turn SELECT 1
expect curpage 4
turn SELECT 1
expect curpage 1
shot gmix_levels.png
turn SELECT -1
expect curpage 4
shot gmix_wrap_left.png
turn SELECT -1
expect curpage 3
shot gmix_pans.png
